1. Create sale record ✅ SUCCESS
2. Insert sale_items with id auto-generated ✅ AUTO UUID
3. Database processes transaction normally ✅ NO HANG
4. Frontend gets success response ✅ COMPLETES
5. User sees completed transaction ✅ BUSINESS WORKS
```

